flowchart TB
    O["Typed operations<br/>read · write · assert · witness"] --> P["Compose a program<br/>sequence · branches · calls"]
    P --> C["Check types, scope,<br/>declarations and resource bounds"]
    C --> N["Native adapter<br/>result + next context"]
    C --> R["Recorded adapter<br/>execution + ordered trace"]
    C --> A["Capability report<br/>available APIs or a reason for refusal"]
    R --> V["Separate proof and transaction gates<br/>verify · apply · replay"]
